---

<section class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl border-t border-gray-200/50 px-6 py-32">
  <div class="mb-20 max-w-xl text-left">
    <h2
      class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 text-gray-1000 font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight"
    >
      How it works.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 md:grid-cols-3">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 text-tertiary mb-3 font-semibold">01 / VERIFICATION</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Verify Enrolment</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
        Verify your active student status via email. The system hashes the email for rate-limiting,
        then discards it immediately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 text-tertiary mb-3 font-semibold">02 / IDENTITY</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Receive a Persona</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
        Get an anonymous avatar and display name. This remains your persistent identity for chat,
        forums, and workshops.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <div class="text-copy-14 text-tertiary mb-3 font-semibold">03 / CONNECT</div>
      <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Access Support</h3>
      <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
        Discuss concerns in open forums, message verified upper-class mentors 1-on-1, or sign up for
        stress-management events.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
